      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's so exhausting to carry that heavy weight every single day, and the emptiness where he should be is a constant, sharp reminder. When everything feels pointless, that's when the pain feels most overwhelming, and it's completely understandable why you feel stuck. If the loop of pain feels unbearable, please consider reaching out to a professional who can offer support and help you navigate these feelings.",
